    &= -2\sum_{i=1}^{n} \hat{\beta_{1}} (\bar{X}  - X_{i}) (Y_{i} - \bar{Y}) - \hat{\beta_{1}}^{2} \sum_{i=1}^{n} (\bar{X}  - X_{i})^{2} \\
